Illustrative Chaitin constant c_F ~ 237300 bits (7910-state TM, ~15 bits per transition).
For the random-per-interval set (D~0.36), K ~ e^(D L) exceeds c_F at L* ~ 34.5, i.e. eps* ~ e^-L* = 1.0e-15 of the system size.
Planck cutoff for a 1 m system: L_P = ln(1 m / 1.6e-35 m) = 80.1
